    {
      "tier": 1,
      "title": "WAL_LOG 建库策略会让旧主库回放时反复崩溃",
      "summary": "PostgreSQL 19 的 WAL_LOG CREATE DATABASE 策略被查出严重缺陷。提交 add323da40a 在 heap_xlog_prune_freeze() 里加了一条断言，要求可见性映射缓冲区为脏。主备切换后，提升为主的备库可见性映射是全零，VACUUM FREEZE 会重新置位并生成不含整页镜像的 PRUNE 记录；重新加入的旧主库回放这些记录时发现位已置好，缓冲区保持干净，于是断言失败、节点反复崩溃重启。",
      "url": "https://www.postgresql.org/message-id/apUTKUUvYfG3SlBF@paquier.xyz",
      "author": "Melanie Plageman",
      "source": "pgsql-hackers",
      "source_date": "2026-08-31",
      "image": "",
      "domain": "pg",
      "tags": [
        "PG19",
        "恢复",
        "复制"
      ],
      "position": 1
    },
    {
      "tier": 1,
      "title": "能源公司迁到 Tiger Cloud 后查询延迟降到 1/25",
      "summary": "Tristan Vermeesch 记录了 Companion.energy 把实时能源传感器数据从 Azure PostgreSQL 迁到 Tiger Cloud 的过程，原环境用的是功能受限的 Apache 2 版 TimescaleDB。迁移后 skip-scan 让最常用查询延迟从 4950 毫秒降到 202 毫秒，Hypercore 列存把 1.7 TB 压到 39 GB。迁移用 LiveSync 复制，历时八周，割接 16 小时。这是厂商案例口径，仍需自行验证。",
      "url": "https://www.tigerdata.com/blog/companion-energy-case-study-tiger-data",
      "author": "Tristan Vermeesch",
      "source": "Tiger Data 博客",
      "source_date": "2026-08-31",
      "image": "https://assets.tigerdata.com/blog/2026/08/companion.energy.png",
      "domain": "pg",
      "tags": [
        "TimescaleDB",
        "迁移",
        "时序"
      ],
      "position": 2
